INSERT INTO movies_fts (slug, name, origin_name, actors, alternative_names) VALUES ('tinh-ban-traigai-lieu-co-ben-lau', 'Tình Bạn Trai-Gái Liệu Có Bền Lâu?', 'Can a Boy-Girl Friendship Survive?', 'tình bạn trai-gái liệu có bền lâu? can a boy-girl friendship survive? kikunosuke toya sayumi suzushiro yuka nukui ko bonkobara masaaki mizunaka hisako kanemoto 男女之间存在纯友情吗？（不，不存在！!） 男女之间的友情存在吗？（不，不存在!!） danjo no yuujou wa seiritsu suru? (iya, shinai!!) danjo no yūjō wa seiritsu suru? (iya, shinai!!) だんじょのゆうじょうはせいりつする いや しないっ だんじょる？ danjoru 男女の友情は成立する？ （いや、しないっ!!） だんじょる danjo no yuujou wa seiritsu suru iya shinai 男女之間存在純友情嗎？（不，不存在！） can a boy–girl friendship hold up? (no, it can''t!!) will friendship be established between men and women? (no, it won''t!!) danjoru - is this friendship between man & woman? (no way!) can friendship between men and women exist? (no, it doesn''t!) can a boy and girl friendship hold up? (no, it can''t!!) can a boy and girl friendship hold up? (no it can''t) can a boy-girl friendship survive? (no it can''t!!) can a boy and girl friendship hold up? (no it won''t!!) can a boy-girl friendship survive? (no it won''t!!) 男女の友情は成立する？（いや、しないっ!!）', '');
