ska, Smrť & Roboti","Любов, смерть та роботи","Любов, смерть + роботи","Love, Death + Robots","Love Death + Robots","Love, Death and Robots","Love Death Robots","Sevgi, o''lim va robotlar","Love, Death & Robots"]', 1784690324155);
