tara Dainana Ouji Datta no de, Kimamani Majutsu o Kiwamemasu","Dainana Ouji","第七王子","Tensei shitara Dainana Ouji Datta node, Kimama ni Majutsu wo Kiwamemasu","Tensei Shitara Dai Nana Ouji Datta no de, Kimamani Majutsu o Kiwamemasu","Dainanaoji","Tensei Shitara Dai Nana Ouji Datta node, Kimamani Majutsu wo Kiwamemasu","Tensei Shitara Dai Nana Ōji Datta no de, Kimamani Majutsu o Kiwamemasu","Tensei Shitara Dai Nana Ōji Datta node, Kimamani Majutsu wo Kiwamemasu","Tensei Shitara Dai Nana Ouji Dattanode Kimamani Majutsu Wo Kiwamemasu","てんせいしたらだいななおうじだったので、きままにまじゅつをきわめます","Tensei Shitara Dai Nana Ōji Datta no de, Kimama ni Majutsu o Kiwamemasu","DaiNanaOuji","Tensei shitara Dainana Ouji","환생했는데 제7왕자라 내맘대로 마술을 연마합니다","환생했는데 제7왕자라 내 맘대로 마술을 연마합니다","轉生為第七王子，隨心所欲的魔法學習之路","轉生為第七王子隨心所欲的魔法學習之路第二季","I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince So I Can Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability","I Can Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability","I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince","Chuyển Sinh Thành Đệ Thất Hoàng Tử, Tôi Quyết Định Trau Dồi Ma Thuật","Chuyển Sinh Thành Đệ Thất Hoàng Tử","転生したら第七王子だったので、気ままに魔術を極めます"]', 1784690324178);
